id: from-goop-sixth-effect
name: 6th effect of From Goop
type: standard
actionCost: 1
actionCostMax: 3
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: from-goop
fromEffect: 6
source: Core Rule
description: >
  For each Action spent, Defeat one of your Goops and regain half of the Life Points they had left.
text: >
  (6)-[1/Round]: As a Standard Maneuver with a Variable Action Cost (1~3 Actions), for each Action spent, Defeat one of your Goops (they cannot trigger a [Triggered/Defeated] effect in response to this effect). If you do, regain Life Points equal to 1/2 of the total amount of Life Points they had remaining. You cannot target a Goop you created this Turn with this effect.

---

# Owned by every character, in the list only while From Goop is had (`fromTrait`), as its 3rd effect's. The Goops ticked - one for
# each Action spent, none made this Turn - Defeated and half their Life back (chat.mjs reabsorbGoops).
[on used]
reabsorbGoops(0);
